      "content": "4. Structure of Cell"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "fb3ow17",
      "content": "Main parts of a cell:"
    },
    {
      "type": "pullQuote",
      "content": "All living organisms are composed of cells and products of cells, and all cells arise from pre-existing cells.",
      "id": "l96fmk2"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "twdp6u9",
      "content": "• Cell membrane"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "7lnfwxn",
      "content": "• Cytoplasm"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "otj05r7",
      "content": "• Nucleus"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1lyye1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "5. Cell Membrane"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "l3zrzii",
      "content": "• Also called plasma membrane."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "um2bbi5",
      "content": "• Controls movement of substances into and out of the cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "4gmj95b",
      "content": "• It is selectively permeable."
    },
